#. metadata.json->name
msgid "aVinceCam"
msgstr "aVinceCam"

#. metadata.json->description
msgid ""
"Camera Control for Linux - find your cameras, preview them, take photos and "
"offer them to browsers"
msgstr ""
"Camera Control for Linux – Kameras finden, Vorschau zeigen, Fotos aufnehmen "
"und für Browser bereitstellen"

