#. settings-schema.json->active-indicator->description
msgid "Panel icon while a preview runs"
msgstr "Panel-Symbol während einer Vorschau"

#. settings-schema.json->active-indicator->options
msgid "Turn slowly"
msgstr "Langsam drehen"

#. settings-schema.json->active-indicator->options
msgid "Pulse with a red dot"
msgstr "Pulsieren mit rotem Punkt"

#. settings-schema.json->active-indicator->options
msgid "No change"
msgstr "Keine Änderung"

#. settings-schema.json->usage-indicator->description
msgid "Show when a program uses a camera"
msgstr "Anzeigen, wenn ein Programm eine Kamera benutzt"

#. settings-schema.json->usage-indicator->tooltip
msgid ""
"Red dot on the panel icon and a line in the menu. aVinceCam only watches the "
"camera device files; it does not open them."
msgstr ""
"Roter Punkt am Panel-Symbol und eine Zeile im Menü. aVinceCam beobachtet nur "
"die Gerätedateien der Kameras, öffnet sie aber nicht."

#. settings-schema.json->head-preview->description
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Vorschau"

#. settings-schema.json->preview-viewer->description
msgid "Preview program"
msgstr "Vorschauprogramm"

#. settings-schema.json->preview-viewer->tooltip
msgid ""
"For libcamera cameras. USB cameras use VLC if it is installed, otherwise "
"GStreamer."
msgstr ""
"Für libcamera-Kameras. USB-Kameras nutzen VLC, falls installiert, sonst "
"GStreamer."

#. settings-schema.json->preview-viewer->options
msgid "qcam (libcamera)"
msgstr "qcam (libcamera)"

#. settings-schema.json->preview-viewer->options
msgid "GStreamer"
msgstr "GStreamer"

#. settings-schema.json->head-photo->description
msgid "Photo"
msgstr "Foto"

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-size->description
msgid "Photo size"
msgstr "Fotogröße"

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-size->tooltip
msgid ""
"Built-in cameras are often soft at full size; 1600 × 1200 keeps their detail "
"in a smaller file. USB cameras use the closest size they offer."
msgstr ""
"Eingebaute Kameras sind in voller Größe oft weich; 1600 × 1200 behält ihre "
"Details in einer kleineren Datei. USB-Kameras nehmen die nächste angebotene "
"Größe."

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-size->options
msgid "1024 × 768"
msgstr "1024 × 768"

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-size->options
msgid "1600 × 1200 (recommended)"
msgstr "1600 × 1200 (empfohlen)"

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-size->options
msgid "2048 × 1536"
msgstr "2048 × 1536"

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-size->options
msgid "2560 × 1920 (full size)"
msgstr "2560 × 1920 (volle Größe)"

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-folder->description
msgid "Folder for photos"
msgstr "Ordner für Fotos"

#. settings-schema.json->snapshot-folder->tooltip
msgid "Empty: the pictures folder, subfolder aVinceCam."
msgstr "Leer: Bilderordner, Unterordner aVinceCam."

#. settings-schema.json->head-lens->description
msgid "Cameras with a focus motor"
msgstr "Kameras mit Fokusmotor"

#. settings-schema.json->allow-lens-cameras->description
msgid "Allow preview of cameras with a focus motor"
msgstr "Vorschau für Kameras mit Fokusmotor erlauben"

#. settings-schema.json->allow-lens-cameras->tooltip
msgid ""
"Preview, photo and virtual camera of such cameras. aVinceCam runs them "
"without libcamera's autofocus: the focus motor is not moved and the focus "
"stays fixed."
msgstr ""
"Vorschau, Foto und virtuelle Kamera solcher Kameras. aVinceCam betreibt sie "
"ohne den libcamera-Autofokus: Der Fokusmotor wird nicht bewegt, die Schärfe "
"bleibt fest eingestellt."

#. settings-schema.json->use-libcamera-autofocus->description
msgid "Use libcamera's autofocus"
msgstr "libcamera-Autofokus benutzen"

#. settings-schema.json->use-libcamera-autofocus->tooltip
msgid ""
"libcamera then moves the focus motor while the camera streams. Only switch "
"this on if the focus motor works: if it does not answer, every attempt ends "
"up as an error in the system log."
msgstr ""
"libcamera bewegt dann den Fokusmotor, während die Kamera Bilder liefert. Nur "
"einschalten, wenn der Fokusmotor funktioniert: Antwortet er nicht, landet "
"jeder Versuch als Fehler im Systemprotokoll."
